policy   : handoff: unsatisfied mandatory inputs -> refused (HANDOFF_INPUTS_UNSATISFIED); stale packet -> re-delivered at current inputs, degraded when work was in progress on the stale inputs; session close: ne

### G0 — every privileged/mutating command is guarded (census under FREEZE_WRITES)
task create --objective x --title x --class governance --allowed docs/x FROZEN
task status TASK-0001 READY                                FROZEN
gate create --question q --fields {}                       FROZEN
adapters generate                                          FROZEN
memory heldout-starter                                     FROZEN
adopt baseline                                             FROZEN
telemetry emit --name x --attrs {}                         OK
plugins list                                               OK
(telemetry emit and plugins list are machine-local derived state / read-only, allowed by design)
